    {
      "source": "Provides access to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#out\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.out</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#err\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.err</code></a>\noutput that has been captured by the <a href=\"OutputCaptureExtension.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.system\"><code>OutputCaptureExtension</code></a> or\n<a href=\"OutputCaptureRule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.system\"><code>OutputCaptureRule</code></a>. Can be used to apply assertions either using AssertJ or\nstandard JUnit assertions. For example: <pre class=\"code\">assertThat(output).contains(\"started\"); // Checks all output\nassertThat(output.getErr()).contains(\"failed\"); // Only checks System.err\nassertThat(output.getOut()).contains(\"ok\"); // Only checks System.out\n</pre>",
      "translation": "提供对由 <a href=\"OutputCaptureExtension.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.system\"><code>OutputCaptureExtension</code></a> 或\n<a href=\"OutputCaptureRule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.system\"><code>OutputCaptureRule</code></a> 捕获的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#out\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.out</code></a> 和\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#err\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.err</code></a>\n输出的访问权限。可用于使用 AssertJ 或标准 JUnit 断言应用断言。例如：<pre class=\"code\">assertThat(output).contains(\"started\"); // 检查所有输出\nassertThat(output.getErr()).contains(\"failed\"); // 仅检查 System.err\nassertThat(output.getOut()).contains(\"ok\"); // 仅检查 System.out\n</pre>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return all content (both <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#out\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.out</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#err\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.err</code></a>) in the order that it was captured.",
      "translation": "按捕获顺序返回所有内容（包括<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#out\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.out</code></a>和<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#err\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.err</code></a>）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#err\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.err</code></a> content in the order that it was captured.",
      "translation": "返回按捕获顺序的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#err\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.err</code></a> 内容。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#out\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.out</code></a> content in the order that it was captured.",
      "translation": "返回捕获时记录的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/System.html#out\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>System.out</code></a> 内容。",
